WEBVTT

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:02.235
Currently, we've taken on
five bodies in C Area.

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:05.672
Currently, we've taken on
five bodies in C Area.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:05.939
Currently, we've taken on
five bodies in C Area.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:10.740
Search of G Area is complete.
Proceeding to search N Area.

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:14.781
Found a survivor!

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.283
He's still breathing!

00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:18.444
Get a transport helicopter on the double!

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.036
What's this?

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.663
Resonance?

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:59.826
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:05.665
sono itami no imi sae

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:11.404
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:14.635
Boku wa kitto...

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:22.349
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:01:22.349 --> 00:01:29.890
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:32.759
I'll always be with you

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.395
see the sky in front of you

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:39.764
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:46.907
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:01:46.907 --> 00:01:49.576
utau yo

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:58.245
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:02:09.763 --> 00:02:14.801
What? Take the Lindworm
Unit off of D Project?

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.803
Temporarily.

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:18.471
And?

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:22.142
Leave D Project to the Vritra Unit for now,

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:25.111
send the Lindworm Unit
to the city on the Moon,

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:29.082
where the Album is thought
to be hiding, and capture her.

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:33.253
A live, Original Dragon would
be an important test subject

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:35.255
for understanding Thanatos.

00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:37.624
In that sense, you can consider
the capture of the Album

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:40.559
to be an important segment of D Project.

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:46.833
But currently, the Girouard Force
is on exercises on the Moon.

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:50.170
Their objective is Gio; ours is the Album.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:54.300
Whatever can be used to each
other's advantage should be.

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:07.520
Gio!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.991
Guys, at ease, but listen up.

00:03:10.991 --> 00:03:14.494
Orders to deploy to the
Moon have come down.

00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:18.264
So then, we're going to go get Gio back?

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:24.004
Our mission is to capture
the Album, not Gio.

00:03:24.004 --> 00:03:26.700
Kazuki, you're to stand by here.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:42.856
Come on, let's go, Howling Star.

00:03:42.856 --> 00:03:44.687
Raina...

00:03:54.034 --> 00:03:56.169
What is it you have in mind,

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:59.372
suddenly proposing that
we capture the Album?

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:02.642
You're the one that told me
to do it, aren't you?

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:06.212
It's about the accident, then.

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:08.314
What are you trying to say?

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:10.509
Oh, nothing.

00:04:12.152 --> 00:04:15.522
There's still a lot that I want to know.

00:04:15.522 --> 00:04:18.892
Once we get the Album,
and Gio comes back...

00:04:18.892 --> 00:04:20.827
I'm not so sure.

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:26.699
Even if the Girouard Force catches Gio,
they won't turn him over to us.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:27.934
Why not?!

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:32.739
They want to obtain the
formula for Resonance.

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:37.377
Gio is a live test subject for them, as well.

00:04:37.377 --> 00:04:40.280
If you were aware of that, then why?

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:44.784
You're willing to turn over
the Resonance formula to them?

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:49.923
It would be asking too much
to try to obtain everything,

00:04:49.923 --> 00:04:52.448
Dr. Kitajima.

00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:12.712
Damn, it's no use.

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:15.081
You can't hear Toa's song?

00:05:15.081 --> 00:05:18.608
Why can't I?! I could hear it before!

00:05:21.254 --> 00:05:23.085
Only one thing to do now.

00:05:25.592 --> 00:05:26.826
Let's go!

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:28.495
Why is he taking charge?

00:05:28.495 --> 00:05:32.799
All high-strung for nothing.
And he was so relaxed earlier, too.

00:05:32.799 --> 00:05:35.996
Incarnate!!

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:56.811
Howling Star, take off!

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:17.833
Let's go, Machina!

00:06:47.907 --> 00:06:49.534
Amadeus!

00:07:00.153 --> 00:07:02.655
Once we arrive at the city
on the Moon, we'll rendezvous

00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:05.491
with the Girouard Force,
and come up with a joint strategy.

00:07:05.491 --> 00:07:06.826
Got it?

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:08.361
Roger!

00:07:08.361 --> 00:07:10.597
Roger.

00:07:10.597 --> 00:07:14.000
I want to know the truth!
That's why I'm going to go see Toa.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.059
See her, and find out for sure!

00:08:13.593 --> 00:08:16.562
No leads here, either.

00:08:16.562 --> 00:08:18.154
Damn...

00:08:21.134 --> 00:08:23.762
All right, we'll try that shop next.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:32.078
Welcome.

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:34.113
Please, sit anywhere you'd like.

00:08:34.113 --> 00:08:36.015
Toa...

00:08:36.015 --> 00:08:38.351
Do you know a girl named Toa?

00:08:38.351 --> 00:08:42.655
- Toa?
- Do you know her?!

00:08:42.655 --> 00:08:44.791
No, I don't.

00:08:44.791 --> 00:08:46.592
I'm sorry.

00:08:46.592 --> 00:08:51.620
I see. I'm sorry for having disturbed you.

00:09:02.809 --> 00:09:04.800
That way now.

00:09:13.986 --> 00:09:15.455
I'm back.

00:09:15.455 --> 00:09:19.025
Welcome back. Sorry to have to
send you out shopping for me.

00:09:19.025 --> 00:09:22.862
Mm-mm, I'm sorry for having taken so long.

00:09:22.862 --> 00:09:25.498
I got lost on the way back.

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:29.869
There was a boy who just
came in asking about you.

00:09:29.869 --> 00:09:32.372
Oh? I wonder who that could be.

00:09:32.372 --> 00:09:34.741
I lied to them about you.

00:09:34.741 --> 00:09:36.800
Is that what you want?

00:09:59.332 --> 00:10:01.000
Stop goofing around!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.865
Oh, that hurt!

00:10:06.072 --> 00:10:10.276
I found this in Amagi's room.

00:10:10.276 --> 00:10:15.681
This is a unique fiber, only used
in Girouard Force uniforms.

00:10:15.681 --> 00:10:17.116
The Girouard Force?

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:21.687
Why would this turn up in Amagi's room?

00:10:21.687 --> 00:10:24.121
Let's go talk somewhere more relaxed.

00:10:32.198 --> 00:10:36.469
ISDA, Lindworm Unit, reporting our arrival.

00:10:36.469 --> 00:10:39.372
I'm the commander, Raina Cromwell.

00:10:39.372 --> 00:10:41.908
Garnet Maclaine.

00:10:41.908 --> 00:10:46.312
If the ISDA's aces are showing up
personally, they must mean business.

00:10:46.312 --> 00:10:50.750
We always mean business.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.319
Show the Lindworm Unit in.

00:10:53.319 --> 00:10:56.155
Yes, ma'am. This way, please.

00:10:56.155 --> 00:10:58.146
We will see you later.

00:11:19.579 --> 00:11:22.139
Here, use this, if you like.

00:11:24.617 --> 00:11:26.252
Perfume?

00:11:26.252 --> 00:11:28.982
You smell like tobacco.

00:11:34.794 --> 00:11:38.097
As a result of my search,
I detected a certain component

00:11:38.097 --> 00:11:41.667
of perfume on the fiber.

00:11:41.667 --> 00:11:46.672
I only know of one soldier
who uses that perfume.

00:11:46.672 --> 00:11:50.343
A high-ranking officer
in the Girouard Force.

00:11:50.343 --> 00:11:52.111
Major Garnet?

00:11:52.111 --> 00:11:57.208
I'm off to the Moon for a bit, to make sure.

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:06.959
When the extraterrestrial
life forms we call Dragons

00:12:06.959 --> 00:12:10.963
are Communicators, they each
emit their own unique pulse,

00:12:10.963 --> 00:12:13.900
the same as when they
perform their special abilities.

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:17.637
If we can pick that up, it's possible
to pinpoint their location.

00:12:17.637 --> 00:12:23.242
I know. But, can that child do it?

00:12:23.242 --> 00:12:25.233
I'm doing it now.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.416
We'll catch that Album this time for sure!

00:12:30.416 --> 00:12:35.688
Indeed we shall. Let us
marshal Gio along with her.

00:12:35.688 --> 00:12:37.590
Marshal?

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:40.821
Wow, you sure know
some hard words, don't you?

00:12:42.728 --> 00:12:45.331
Is it still on your mind?

00:12:45.331 --> 00:12:49.335
About Spirytus? I've gotten over it.

00:12:49.335 --> 00:12:52.271
Or rather, I've stopped
thinking too deeply about it.

00:12:52.271 --> 00:12:58.444
I just have to do as Raina tells me to.
That's our destiny, after all.

00:12:58.444 --> 00:13:01.047
Destiny...

00:13:01.047 --> 00:13:02.448
Damn.

00:13:02.448 --> 00:13:05.042
How can we not find her,
after all we've searched?

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:12.458
Where are you, Toa?

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:14.860
I'm...

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.851
I'm lonely, all by myself.

00:13:25.972 --> 00:13:28.207
Why did you follow me to the Moon?

00:13:28.207 --> 00:13:30.937
If you involve yourself with me any further...

00:13:32.812 --> 00:13:34.439
Jin...

00:13:41.988 --> 00:13:46.448
I hear her. I hear Toa's song! This way!

00:13:52.431 --> 00:13:54.058
Here.

00:13:55.401 --> 00:13:59.972
It's a mocha blend. A dear friend
of mine liked it this way.

00:13:59.972 --> 00:14:02.341
Thanks.

00:14:02.341 --> 00:14:05.244
But that was a long time ago.

00:14:05.244 --> 00:14:10.249
We got into a fight over some
petty thing, and that was the end of it.

00:14:10.249 --> 00:14:13.653
I should have just apologized,
without being so stubborn, and now,

00:14:13.653 --> 00:14:15.821
I regret it.

00:14:15.821 --> 00:14:18.324
You can't reach them?

00:14:18.324 --> 00:14:21.160
No, I can't.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:24.130
He's dead, after all.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:28.328
Now we'll be caught up in our fight forever.

00:14:31.637 --> 00:14:34.940
I won't ask you what happened.

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.877
But there are times when you'll
want to see someone again,

00:14:37.877 --> 00:14:40.146
but you won't be able to.

00:14:40.146 --> 00:14:43.516
Don't make the same mistake I did.

00:14:43.516 --> 00:14:46.686
Don't lie to yourself about what you feel.

00:14:46.686 --> 00:14:51.020
My... my feelings...

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:55.961
Jin!

00:14:55.961 --> 00:15:00.700
Go on, hurry along. I'm sure
the one you love is waiting.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.327
Thanks!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:25.357
I have a reading on the
pulse sensor. Pattern Album!

00:15:25.357 --> 00:15:28.155
- What's her point?
- City sector 3!

00:15:36.335 --> 00:15:38.437
Jin!

00:15:38.437 --> 00:15:40.268
Jin!!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.269
Found you!

00:15:47.012 --> 00:15:48.347
Keep out of my way!

00:15:48.347 --> 00:15:50.747
We are unable to oblige!

00:15:55.521 --> 00:15:57.113
Jin!

00:15:58.591 --> 00:16:00.593
You won't get away!

00:16:00.593 --> 00:16:02.254
Toa!

00:16:08.234 --> 00:16:09.963
We've caught you!

00:16:12.605 --> 00:16:14.573
Run, Toa!

00:16:16.609 --> 00:16:18.304
Jin is waiting for you down below!

00:16:19.545 --> 00:16:21.536
Hold it, Album!

00:16:23.482 --> 00:16:25.718
What do you think you're doing, Gio?!

00:16:25.718 --> 00:16:27.887
I am protecting Toa.

00:16:27.887 --> 00:16:30.754
Is that right? Well then, I've got no choice.

00:16:31.991 --> 00:16:35.927
Summon Duel Spear!!

00:16:37.997 --> 00:16:39.828
I'm going to defeat you!

00:16:55.948 --> 00:16:58.250
Jin!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.184
Toa!

00:17:07.459 --> 00:17:10.292
- Toa!
- Please excuse me.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.598
Jin!

00:17:12.598 --> 00:17:14.429
Toa!

00:17:16.368 --> 00:17:18.029
Let me go!

00:17:24.009 --> 00:17:28.275
I didn't come here to capture you.

00:17:29.648 --> 00:17:32.518
Tell me...

00:17:32.518 --> 00:17:36.045
What were we born for?

00:17:42.361 --> 00:17:47.333
Not bad! You handle yourself well
for a baby who was just born.

00:17:47.333 --> 00:17:50.336
I was born to protect Toa.

00:17:50.336 --> 00:17:52.838
Anyone who gets in the way
of doing that will get no mercy,

00:17:52.838 --> 00:17:55.474
no matter who they are!

00:17:55.474 --> 00:17:57.810
What good does it do to protect the Album?

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.646
Once she gets back together
with that Kamishina Jin guy,

00:18:00.646 --> 00:18:04.016
you'll be the one who's in the way!

00:18:04.016 --> 00:18:06.485
In the way?

00:18:06.485 --> 00:18:10.723
You were not born to protect the Album.

00:18:10.723 --> 00:18:13.726
Those of us who are earth-born Dragons

00:18:13.726 --> 00:18:17.696
were born to obey people... our Masters.

00:18:17.696 --> 00:18:19.527
That is our destiny!

00:18:21.901 --> 00:18:23.528
No!

00:18:37.416 --> 00:18:39.543
Gio!

00:18:46.191 --> 00:18:48.961
He got away, did he?

00:18:48.961 --> 00:18:54.524
Were we born to kill other
Dragons... our own kind?

00:18:56.101 --> 00:18:58.804
If that's the case, it's more than tragic.

00:18:58.804 --> 00:19:00.739
It's fate.

00:19:00.739 --> 00:19:06.111
My meeting Jin and Gio,
and your being born,

00:19:06.111 --> 00:19:08.102
it's all fate.

00:19:09.782 --> 00:19:12.251
Fate...

00:19:12.251 --> 00:19:18.757
Dragons and Masters are bound
together tightly by their Resonance.

00:19:18.757 --> 00:19:21.160
Not this again.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:24.663
Dragons cannot go against their Masters.

00:19:24.663 --> 00:19:30.602
And yet, you broke that rule,
and began acting together with Gio.

00:19:30.602 --> 00:19:32.738
To be blunt, you're a pain.

00:19:32.738 --> 00:19:35.674
This doesn't have anything to do with me.

00:19:35.674 --> 00:19:38.978
More importantly, what are
you going to do with Toa?!

00:19:38.978 --> 00:19:41.780
Little man...

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:46.919
Young Miss, it is time we were
getting him to the spaceport.

00:19:46.919 --> 00:19:49.822
- Right.
- Just a minute.

00:19:49.822 --> 00:19:52.491
I'll take him, instead.

00:19:52.491 --> 00:19:54.827
Oh, no, allow me.

00:19:54.827 --> 00:19:57.029
It's okay, it's okay.

00:19:57.029 --> 00:20:01.100
Come on, get up. Snap to, and step lively!

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.931
What's with her?

00:20:15.981 --> 00:20:19.985
Toa is waiting for you at Sherry's shop.

00:20:19.985 --> 00:20:22.654
The café where you asked about her today.

00:20:22.654 --> 00:20:25.190
Toa is there?

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:28.327
Machina contacted me a while back.

00:20:28.327 --> 00:20:30.396
- Go on.
- Why?

00:20:30.396 --> 00:20:32.455
Never mind, just go.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:40.973
Don't get caught.

00:20:40.973 --> 00:20:43.032
Now then...

00:20:48.047 --> 00:20:52.851
The Album said that it
was our fate to be born.

00:20:52.851 --> 00:20:54.486
The Album did?

00:20:54.486 --> 00:20:57.589
Not destiny, but fate.

00:20:57.589 --> 00:20:59.580
Do you know the difference?

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:06.565
One cannot change one's destiny,
but one can change one's fate.

00:21:06.565 --> 00:21:08.999
Of our own will.

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:15.069
Our... will...

00:21:32.724 --> 00:21:34.593
Toa!

00:21:34.593 --> 00:21:36.220
Jin!

00:21:48.874 --> 00:21:51.777
I'll never leave you again!

00:21:51.777 --> 00:21:53.608
Jin...

00:22:07.426 --> 00:22:14.099
Me to me ga atta shunkan

00:22:14.099 --> 00:22:20.906
kanashimi ga hajimaru ki ga shita

00:22:20.906 --> 00:22:27.579
Keshite mo kienai kioku ima demo

00:22:27.579 --> 00:22:34.781
futari no kokoro tsunaide'ru

00:22:36.622 --> 00:22:43.462
Ikusen no hoshi no kazu hodo hito wa

00:22:43.462 --> 00:22:46.465
afurete iru no ni ne

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:50.335
kimi shika mienai

00:22:50.335 --> 00:22:53.505
Aenakute mo

00:22:53.505 --> 00:22:56.441
kanawanakute mo

00:22:56.441 --> 00:23:02.714
tsunoru omoi wa kitto eien

00:23:02.714 --> 00:23:09.721
Unmei ga futari wo hikisaku nara

00:23:09.721 --> 00:23:16.562
deaeta koto dake wo kiseki to shinjite

00:23:16.562 --> 00:23:23.168
Hora nagarete'ku kono ame no you

00:23:23.168 --> 00:23:29.208
Itoshisa dake wo kimi ni furasetai

00:23:29.208 --> 00:23:33.406
Rain of Love

00:23:42.854 --> 00:23:47.226
Say, Ryoko-san, Ryoko-san, I love bathing!

00:23:47.226 --> 00:23:50.896
? Goin' on a trip... Haa biba non non!?

00:23:50.896 --> 00:23:54.833
Stay in too long, and you'll get
all pruney. Especially around here!

00:23:54.833 --> 00:23:56.768
Don't pinch my tummy!

00:23:56.768 --> 00:23:58.604
What are you two doing?

00:23:58.604 --> 00:24:01.573
We were thinking of going
for a bath, if only in spirit.

00:24:01.573 --> 00:24:04.910
You seem to be fairly fixated
on hot springs. You don't mean...

00:24:04.910 --> 00:24:06.044
Yep! Next time...

00:24:06.044 --> 00:24:09.536
Summer! Bathing suits! Hot springs!
And there'll be tears, too.
